{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sign</strong> is a visual novel series inspired by <strong>fault</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >=========================================================================</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On an early summer night, <strong>Tian Qin</strong>\u2014a high school girl out for a stroll\u2014unexpectedly encounters <strong>Cygnus</strong>, a witch from another world. Stranded in an unfamiliar realm with her powers lost, the witch entrusts herself to Tian Qin, hoping the girl can help recover her missing abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the same time, an enormous tree suddenly erupts overnight in Central Park, becoming a sensational phenomenon. In just one night, their city of <strong>Longhua</strong> transforms into a bustling destination, overrun by countless visitors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the witch's arrival, cracks begin to form in what was once &quot;ordinary life,&quot; as if a vast maelstrom were pulling the entire world into chaos...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >=========================================================================</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788590/extras/5346c7af11b57dc5b55fb4f28eea56bb.avif?t=1768674008\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788590/extras_big/5346c7af11b57dc5b55fb4f28eea56bb.avif?t=1768674008 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cygnus</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A witch from another world. <br>Stripped of her powers and left with only fragmented memories, she finds herself in a desperate situation upon arriving in this world. <br>Though this realm lacks mana, she can still cast simple spells using the magic stored within her body.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788590/extras/73aad7ed4d0f9b38d8a8a1af359e6d52.avif?t=1768674008\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788590/extras_big/73aad7ed4d0f9b38d8a8a1af359e6d52.avif?t=1768674008 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tian Qin</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A carefree, somewhat rebellious high school girl. <br>She hates boredom and despises monotonous routines\u2014until the day she meets Cygnus. <br>Her extraordinary physical abilities set her apart, but they also hide a secret buried deep in her heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788590/extras/227b37b2dfc873d85a06120c62209759.avif?t=1768674008\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788590/extras_big/227b37b2dfc873d85a06120c62209759.avif?t=1768674008 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Yang Xi</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tian Qin's closest friend. <br>After enduring hardships in the past, she's finally living a life she can call &quot;normal.&quot; <br>But soon, she too will be swept into the gathering storm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3788590?t=1768674008","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788590/69a9913850642ac46d46769ec7e701310d7efbaa/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768674008","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788590/a066a3acb76e327f54ac00a2b8e9edc88e739546/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768674008","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788590/a066a3acb76e327f54ac00a2b8e9edc88e739546/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768674008","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3790000,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sign</strong> is a visual novel series inspired by <strong>fault</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >=========================================================================</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On an early summer night, <strong>Tian Qin</strong>\u2014a high school girl out for a stroll\u2014unexpectedly encounters <strong>Cygnus</strong>, a witch from another world. Stranded in an unfamiliar realm with her powers lost, the witch entrusts herself to Tian Qin, hoping the girl can help recover her missing abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the same time, an enormous tree suddenly erupts overnight in Central Park, becoming a sensational phenomenon. In just one night, their city of <strong>Longhua</strong> transforms into a bustling destination, overrun by countless visitors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the witch's arrival, cracks begin to form in what was once &quot;ordinary life,&quot; as if a vast maelstrom were pulling the entire world into chaos...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >=========================================================================</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.a